/* ===========================================================================
  
   Name:            vnim_ipcl_reqdata_process
  
   Description:     Function to send the request data to host through IPCL
                    whenever HMI needs some data from CAN frame then those 
                    request are satisfied with this function
  
   Inputs:          ipcl_index
  
   Returns:         none
  
   =========================================================================*/

